sequenceDiagram
    box rgb(240,240,240) Flow 1: RayJob Submission
    participant User as User / Data Scientist
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant Webhook as Webhook Server<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Operator as KubeRay Operator
    participant Dashboard as Ray Dashboard<br/>8265/TCP HTTP
    participant Head as Ray Head Pod
    participant Workers as Ray Worker Pods<br/>10001/TCP, 6379/TCP
    end

    Note over User,Workers: Flow 1: RayJob Submission
    User->>K8sAPI: kubectl apply RayJob CR<br/>Auth: Bearer Token
    K8sAPI->>Webhook: Validate RayJob<br/>9443/TCP HTTPS
    Webhook-->>K8sAPI: Admitted
    K8sAPI-->>User: RayJob created
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Watch RayJob events<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: RayJob CR event
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create RayCluster + Pods<br/>443/TCP HTTPS, SA Token
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Resources created
    Operator->>Dashboard: Submit job via REST API<br/>8265/TCP HTTP<br/>Auth: Bearer (x-ray-authorization)
    Dashboard->>Head: Execute job
    Head->>Workers: Distribute tasks<br/>10001/TCP, 6379/TCP<br/>plaintext or mTLS (cert-manager)
    Workers-->>Head: Task results
    Head-->>Dashboard: Job complete
    Operator->>Dashboard: Poll job status (cache client)<br/>8265/TCP HTTP
    Dashboard-->>Operator: Job status

    Note over User,Workers: Flow 2: Authenticated Dashboard Access (RHOAI 3.x)
    participant Gateway as Platform Gateway<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    participant RBAC as kube-rbac-proxy<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS

    User->>Gateway: Browse to dashboard<br/>443/TCP HTTPS<br/>Auth: Browser session
    Gateway->>RBAC: Forward via HTTPRoute<br/>8443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+<br/>Auth: Forwarded token
    RBAC->>K8sAPI: TokenReview + SubjectAccessReview<br/>443/TCP HTTPS TLS 1.2+
    K8sAPI-->>RBAC: Auth decision
    RBAC->>Dashboard: Proxy to dashboard<br/>8265/TCP HTTP<br/>(post-auth, plaintext)
    Dashboard-->>RBAC: Dashboard HTML
    RBAC-->>Gateway: Authenticated response
    Gateway-->>User: Dashboard page

    Note over User,Workers: Flow 3: RayService Incremental Upgrade
    participant ServGW as Gateway (Gateway API)<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    participant ActiveSvc as Active RayCluster<br/>serve-svc 8000/TCP
    participant PendingSvc as Pending RayCluster<br/>serve-svc 8000/TCP

    User->>ServGW: Inference request<br/>80/TCP HTTP
    ServGW->>ActiveSvc: Route (weight: 80%)<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    ServGW->>PendingSvc: Route (weight: 20%)<br/>8000/TCP HTTP
    ActiveSvc-->>ServGW: Response
    PendingSvc-->>ServGW: Response
    ServGW-->>User: Response
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Update HTTPRoute weights<br/>CRD update (stepSizePercent)
